title: Internal Security
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, national_def
on-arrival: interior_policy_timer = 2
view-if: psi_in_government = 1 and (interior_minister_party = psi_name or (liberal_crackdown_accepted and not crackdown_done)) and interior_policy_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/FilippoTurati.jpg

= Internal Security

[? if interior_minister_party = psi_name: Being in control of the Interior Ministry, we hold control of the <span style="color:#FF2400">Carabinieri</span>, the national gendarmerie, alongside the War Ministry, we can take care of the unstable internal situation of Italy. ?]

[? if liberal_crackdown_accepted and not interior_minister_party = psi_name : Although not in control of the Interior Ministry, our coalition partners have given us temporary control over matters of the <span style="color:#FF2400">Carabinieri</span>. ?]

- @loyalty_interior: Improve the loyalty of the <span style="color:#FF2400">Carabinieri</span>.
- @investigate_corruption: Investigate corruption by big businesses.
- @crackdown_far_right: Crack down on paramilitary organisations among the far right.
- @crackdown_republican: Crack down on paramilitary organisations among the <span style="color:#3CB371">republicans</span>.
- @crackdown_far_left: Crack down on paramilitary organisations among the far left.
- @domestic_enemies: Investigate or ban our domestic enemies.
- @root: Take no action for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@loyalty_interior
view-if: interior_minister_party = psi_name
on-arrival: interior_police_loyalty += 0.5;

With some specific reassignments and improved training methods, we can root out reactionary and sympathetic <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">fascist</span> influence within the <span style="color:#FF2400">Carabinieri</span>.

Current <span style="color:#FF2400">Carabinieri</span> loyalty: [+ interior_police_loyalty : loyalty +]

@investigate_corruption
view-if: interior_minister_party = psi_name
go-to: investigate_corruption_success if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.5; investigate_corruption_failure if interior_police_loyalty < 0.5

@investigate_corruption_success
on-arrival: investigate_corruption += 1; workers_psi += 20; middle_class_psi += 20; workers_clc += 5 if centre_left_coalition; middle_class_clc += 5 if centre_left_coalition; workers_scc += 5; middle_class_psi += 5; inflation -= 1

Corruption in big business is rampant, of course. We have uncovered a number of scandals, and publicizing them brings new attention to the work of Interior Minister [+ interior_minister +], building up his popular appeal and that of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span>.

@investigate_corruption_failure

Unfortunately, our investigations have failed to turn up anything. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by infiltrators within the <span style="color:#FF2400">Carabinieri</span>.

@crackdown_far_right
go-to: crackdown_far_right_success if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.5 or (liberal_crackdown_accepted and not interior_minister_party = psi_name); crackdown_far_right_failure if interior_police_loyalty < 0.5 and interior_minister_party = psi_name

@crackdown_far_right_success
on-arrival: crackdown_far_right += 1 if liberal_crackdown_accepted; fascist_bomb_timer += 20 if fascist_terror; ard_strength -= 20; fdc_strength -= 20; abl_strength -= 20; liberal_crackdown_complete = 1 if crackdown_far_left > 0; democratisation += 5; nationalist_sentiment -= 5; violent_prevalence -= 0.01

A number of coordinated raids and arrests have slightly paralysed the far-right paramilitaries.

@crackdown_far_right_failure

Unfortunately, our raids have turned up empty, our arrest warrants stalled. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by infiltrators within the <span style="color:#FF2400">Carabinieri</span>.

@crackdown_republican
view-if: violent_revolution and republican_terror
go-to: crackdown_republican_success if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.5; crackdown_republican_failure if interior_police_loyalty < 0.5 and interior_minister_party = psi_name

@crackdown_republican_success
on-arrival: republican_bomb_timer += 20 if fascist_terror; 

A number of coordinated raids and arrests have slightly paralysed the <span style="color:#3CB371">republicans</span> paramilitaries.

@crackdown_republican_failure

Unfortunately, our raids have turned up empty, our arrest warrants stalled. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by infiltrators within the <span style="color:#FF2400">Carabinieri</span>.

@crackdown_far_left
view-if: liberal_crackdown_accepted or communist_terror
go-to: crackdown_far_left_success

@crackdown_far_left_success
on-arrival: crackdown_far_left += 1 if liberal_crackdown_accepted; communist_bomb_timer += 20 if communist_terror; rg_strength -= 20; liberal_crackdown_complete = 1 if crackdown_far_right > 0; democratisation += 5; coalition_dissent -= 5; violent_prevalence -= 0.01; sov_rg_strength *= 0.9 if pcdi_formed; sov_rg_militancy *= 0.9 if pcdi_formed;

A number of coordinated raids and arrests have slightly paralysed the far-left paramilitaries, as well as orders from party leadership to downsize the <span style="color:#c2352b">Red Guards</span>. The left-wing of the party isn't exactly enthused about our decision, to say the least.

